sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant L as Lambda (FastAPI)
    participant D as Aurora
    participant A as AI provider

    B->>L: POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages (JWT)
    L->>L: Check JWT and limits
    L->>D: Save user message, load recent history
    Note over L,D: Connection closed before streaming
    L->>A: Stream request
    loop Each chunk
        A-->>L: Text
        L-->>B: SSE data with delta
    end
    L->>D: Save the full reply
    L-->>B: data [DONE]
